Runtime integrations include Cider and its PluginKit message interface,
playerctl/MPRIS, Kitty/kitten, CAVA, ImageMagick, Chafa, and notify-send.
Pywal integration reads a local JSON palette; amui does not run Pywal.
The bundled Favorites Bridge is amui's adapter, not a copy of PluginKit.

Lyrics are retrieved from LRCLIB. Artwork may be read from local MPRIS paths
or fetched from Apple's mzstatic.com hosts. Optional Last.fm and ListenBrainz
integrations submit listening metadata. See docs/PROJECT.md for data flows.
